ticcltools
------------------------------------------
A collection of tools to process ticcl files

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libticcl-devel-0.11-1bl2
  libticcl1-0.11-1bl2
  libticcutils-devel-0.38-1bl2
  libticcutils10-0.38-1bl2
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libticcutils-devel-0.38-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/ticcltools

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/ticcltools/releases/download/v0.11/ticcltools-0.11.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ticcltools-0.11-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ticcltools-0.11-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ticcltools-0.11-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ticcltools-0.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libticcl1-0.11-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libticcl-devel-0.11-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

